{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json",
  "description": "TODO: 1) Make the x axis (Horsepower) start at 40 and the y axis (Miles_per_Gallon) end at 47 with `scale`. 2) In a second chart, use a logarithmic x scale. When is a log scale justified?",
